{"source":"github","project_id":"gt-extras","target":"posit-dev/gt-extras","id":"pr/96","ref":96,"title":"feat: `gt_plt_bar_pct()`","description":"Closes #93 \r\n\r\n@juleswg23, here's a draft of the current work.\r\n```python\r\nimport polars as pl\r\nfrom great_tables import GT\r\nimport gt_extras as gte\r\n\r\ndf = pl.DataFrame({\"x\": [1.0, 20.8, 40.6, 60.4, None, 100.0]}).with_columns(\r\n    pl.col(\"x\").alias(\"x_unscaled\"), pl.col(\"x\").alias(\"x_scaled\")\r\n)\r\n\r\ngt = GT(df)\r\n\r\n(\r\n    gt.pipe(\r\n        gte.gt_plt_bar_pct,\r\n        column=[\"x_unscaled\"],\r\n        scaled=False,\r\n        labels=True,\r\n        fill=\"green\",\r\n    ).pipe(\r\n        gte.gt_plt_bar_pct,\r\n        scaled=True,\r\n        labels=True,\r\n        column=[\"x_scaled\"],\r\n    )\r\n)\r\n```\r\n\u003cimg width=\"345\" height=\"337\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1655fcb0-396c-46e2-a722-8256e4121878\" /\u003e\r\n\r\nThe code sets up a basic scaffold, but there are two points I'm still unsure about:\r\n\r\n* What label should be displayed when `labels=True` and `scaled=False`?\r\n* How should the label position be determined for both cases of `label_cutoff`?\r\n","published_at":"2025-07-10T12:42:45Z","updated_at":"2025-07-11T16:40:02Z","url":"https://github.com/posit-dev/gt-extras/pull/96","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"jrycw","merged_at":"2025-07-11T16:40:02Z","state":"MERGED"}}
